      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIVE MILE ROSE (4) is racing well without winning, recording four minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when third (20.05) over 340m at this track. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Capable of going well again. VERY BEST BUDDY (2) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 340m behind Armatree Diesel (20.66) in a Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior. Expected to give a good account. MARVIN MONELLI (1) was out of the placings last time when seventh at this track (20.27) but did record second best time of the card when winning four back. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Leading chance. VALENTINO BEACH (8) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
